What:		/proc/rpmh_modem/sleepinfo
Date:		December 2019
Contact:	OPLUS power-management maintainers
Description:
		Bounded 100 KiB text hand-off buffer for modem subsystem sleep
		statistics. The ColorOS qmi_master_stats_service appends reports
		to this node and the power-monitoring stack reads the accumulated
		text. Writing the exact OPLUS_MARK_RESTART command resets the
		buffer to a restart marker.

		The backing allocation is capped and additional data is truncated
		once the buffer is full.
